stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Awareness

    Awareness --> ExploringGeM101: Starts the basics module
    Awareness --> ToolEngaged: Opens a tool directly
    ExploringGeM101 --> ToolEngaged: Continues to Eligibility or another tool
    ExploringGeM101 --> SavedForLater: Saves a next action

    ToolEngaged --> EligibilityKnown: Completes Eligibility Checker
    ToolEngaged --> FinancialClarity: Completes a financial tool directly
    ToolEngaged --> SavedForLater: Leaves with saved progress

    EligibilityKnown --> FinancialClarity: Continues to Revenue or ROI
    EligibilityKnown --> GapResolution: Result is Partial
    EligibilityKnown --> ResourceReferral: Result is No
    EligibilityKnown --> DisqualifiedByChoice: Declines government sales

    GapResolution --> EligibilityKnown: Missing requirement completed
    GapResolution --> SavedForLater: Saves fix path or reminder
    ResourceReferral --> GapResolution: Begins a relevant formalization step
    ResourceReferral --> SavedForLater: Accepts workshop or CA referral

    FinancialClarity --> ReportReady: Personalized report composed
    ReportReady --> RegistrationIntent: Opens readiness tracker or action hub
    ReportReady --> SavedForLater: Sends or saves report

    RegistrationIntent --> RegistrationClaimed: User marks registration complete
    RegistrationIntent --> GapResolution: Checklist exposes a missing step
    RegistrationIntent --> SavedForLater: Checklist progress saved

    RegistrationClaimed --> RegistrationVerified: Evidence or partner follow-up verifies it
    RegistrationClaimed --> RegistrationIntent: Verification is incomplete
    RegistrationVerified --> FirstOrderClaimed: User reports first order
    FirstOrderClaimed --> FirstOrderVerified: Evidence or follow-up verifies first order
    FirstOrderClaimed --> RegistrationVerified: First order not yet verifiable

    SavedForLater --> ToolEngaged: Returns to a saved tool
    SavedForLater --> ReportReady: Returns to saved report
    SavedForLater --> RegistrationIntent: Returns to checklist

    DisqualifiedByChoice --> [*]
    FirstOrderVerified --> [*]

    note right of RegistrationClaimed
        A claim and a verified outcome are distinct
        research funnel states
    end note

    note right of SavedForLater
        Leaving with a specific saved next action
        is a valid session outcome, not a dead end
    end note
